## Evidence Summary

**VERIFIED:**
- Quest starts at Record 211 with `G.Knox_Quest = 1`
- Player can investigate (Records 263, 266) or refuse (Record 271)
- Investigation triggers `pc.SetQuest("Knox Asian", 1)` (Records 263, 266)
- Completion triggers `pc.SetQuest("Knox Asian", 4)` and `G.Knox_Quest = 7` (Records 381, 471, 521)
- Bertram quest starts with `G.Knox_Bertram = 1` (Record 151) and reaches stage 2 (Record 481)
- Arthur quest is referenced when Knox completes his quest (Records 311, 351)

**INFERRED:**
- Quest progression follows stages 1→2→4→5→7 (note the jump from 2 to 5)
- Player refusal leads to Knox being angered (G.Knox_Quest = 4)
- Player investigation leads to Asian quest completion
- Bertram quest is dependent on Asian quest completion

**UNKNOWN:**
- Exact quest mechanics and rewards
- Alternative paths and consequences
- Full quest dependencies and branching
- Relationship between Bertram and Asian vampire

